@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam object {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #4338CA
  FontColor #111827
}

title Knaster–Tarski: μ from below (∅), ν from above (S)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LEFT CHAIN — Kleene ASCENT to the LEAST fixpoint μΦ.
' Drawn bottom-to-top with plain -- edges (no arrowheads): the order ⊆ grows
' UPWARD, so ∅ sits at the bottom and the limit μΦ at the top.
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
object "μΦ  (least fixpoint)" as MuTop #DCFCE7
object "…" as MuDots #FEF3C7
object "Φ²(∅)" as Mu2 #FEF3C7
object "Φ(∅)" as Mu1 #FEF3C7
object "∅  (bottom)" as MuBot #FEF3C7

' ascent: each application adds states; ∅ ⊆ Φ(∅) ⊆ Φ²(∅) ⊆ … ⊆ μΦ
MuBot -- Mu1
Mu1 -- Mu2
Mu2 -- MuDots
MuDots -- MuTop

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' RIGHT CHAIN — Kleene DESCENT to the GREATEST fixpoint νΦ.
' Drawn top-to-bottom: S (all states) sits at the TOP and the limit νΦ at the
' bottom, because the iterates SHRINK: S ⊇ Φ(S) ⊇ Φ²(S) ⊇ … ⊇ νΦ.
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
object "S = all states  (top)" as NuTop #FEF3C7
object "Φ(S)" as Nu1 #FEF3C7
object "Φ²(S)" as Nu2 #FEF3C7
object " … " as NuDots #FEF3C7
object "νΦ  (greatest fixpoint)" as NuBot #DCFCE7

' descent: each application removes states; the order ⊇ grows DOWNWARD here
NuTop -- Nu1
Nu1 -- Nu2
Nu2 -- NuDots
NuDots -- NuBot

note bottom of MuBot #E0E7FF
  monotone Φ on the finite powerset lattice (2^S, ⊆); stabilizes in ≤ |S| steps
  (Lemma 3.7) — the for _ in 0..=states.len() loop, stop at next == cur.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#FEF3C7> | still iterating (approximant; not yet a fixed point) |
|<#DCFCE7> | fixed point reached (μΦ at the top of the ascent, νΦ at the bottom of the descent) |
|<#E0E7FF> | law / annotation (lattice + termination) |
endlegend
@enduml
